// AXVERITY_EXTENT_WRITE_PATH step 5a — the flusher's one-shot handoff of the
// run's final durable seq to ack_bench. ack_bench cannot be bound by a channel
// sentinel the way the pipeline stages are: it does not consume the pipeline,
// it races ahead of it waiting on the watermark. This is how it learns where
// the end is, read non-blockingly so learning it never becomes the wait.
channel wp-ack-final-pub
  type Value
end

// The flusher's own self-mailbox for the same cell handle: taken and put back
// at end of stream, the idiom wp-durable-cell already uses.
channel wp-ack-final-cell
  type Value
end

